@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
# Chave real só em apps/backend/.env.local (MESSAGE_INGESTION_API_KEY), não versionada.
@ingestionApiKey = REPLACE_WITH_LOCAL_MESSAGE_INGESTION_API_KEY

### Registrar e logar um usuário (para as rotas /monitors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Teste Monitor", "email": "monitor-http@test.com", "password": "Senha123!"}

###
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "monitor-http@test.com", "password": "Senha123!"}

### Criar monitoramento (nasce pausado) -> 201
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Live de teste",
  "sourceType": "youtube_live",
  "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jfKfPfyJRdk",
  "tags": [{"name": "pergunta", "description": "a question"}, {"name": "elogio"}]
}

### URL de outra plataforma -> 422 (monitor.url.source.mismatch)
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "x", "sourceType": "youtube_live", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/abc/", "tags": []}

### Listar os monitoramentos do usuário -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitors
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Adicionar tag (pausado) -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "spam", "description": "advertising or links"}

### Ingerir com o monitoramento pausado -> 409 (monitor.not_running)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/messages
X-Ingestion-Api-Key: {{ingestionApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId": "yt-1", "authorName": "viewer", "text": "Quanto custa?"}

### Iniciar -> 200 (status running, startedAt = agora)
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Editar tag rodando -> 409 (monitor.must_be_paused)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/tags/spam
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Runner: monitoramentos rodando -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors
X-Ingestion-Api-Key: {{ingestionApiKey}}

### Runner: reportar estado -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/state
X-Ingestion-Api-Key: {{ingestionApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": "watching", "detail": "Monitorando o chat da live."}

### Runner: ingerir (classifica com o Laya na mesma requisição) -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/messages
X-Ingestion-Api-Key: {{ingestionApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId": "yt-1", "authorName": "viewer", "text": "Quanto custa?", "receivedAt": "2026-09-26T22:00:00Z"}

### Mesmo externalId de novo -> 200 com "duplicate": true
POST {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/messages
X-Ingestion-Api-Key: {{ingestionApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"externalId": "yt-1", "authorName": "viewer", "text": "Quanto custa?"}

### Sem chave de API -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/ingestion/monitors

### Mensagens do monitoramento (mais novas primeiro, filtro opcional por tag) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/messages?perPage=20&label=pergunta
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Pausar -> 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Excluir (e as mensagens dele) -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/monitors/{{create.response.body.monitor.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
